name 'designing-reliable-apps-preassessment-q15_2025'

question 'A developer is building a sports app that displays live game scores (which update every minute) and a fixed list of supported sports — basketball, soccer, tennis — that never changes. Which data strategy is most appropriate?'

wrong 'Fetch both the live scores and the sports list from external APIs, since all app data should stay current'
wrong 'Store both the live scores and the sports list as local data in the app for maximum performance'
wrong 'Store the live scores locally and fetch the fixed sports list from an external API each time'
right 'Fetch the live scores from an external API and store the fixed sports list as local data in the app'

allow_multiple_attempts true

